{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/85d2e207e122ab479575dfab072b32d0.avif?t=1772431411\" width=900 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>no signal</i> is an emotional point-and-click hard sci-fi adventure game with a free camera. Explore an abandoned station as you aim to uncover the secrets left by the crew and the marks they left upon the station. Piece together an emotional, introspective story about loneliness and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/b26171626423593cf47a90f920c7fbba.webp?t=1772431411\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/b26171626423593cf47a90f920c7fbba.poster.webp?t=1772431411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=900 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate PGEIST, a remote viewing tool that allows the player to view - and interact - with the full 3d environment where you can examine everything. PGEIST can move through walls and furniture, so you can see things from a different perspective.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/d54c37db173289cb1a053a3300683ece.webp?t=1772431411\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/d54c37db173289cb1a053a3300683ece.poster.webp?t=1772431411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=900 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly complex puzzles, and put together environmental and narrative clues from dialog to progress within an open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/de13473271d6c61f94618f909d118f88.webp?t=1772431411\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/de13473271d6c61f94618f909d118f88.poster.webp?t=1772431411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=900 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peer into the lives of the researchers aboard the station by piecing together conversations, logs, and journal entries.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Royal Entourage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/239abc4963313b0d46b969a7a6b431f98a892375.jpg"},{"name":"Chess, mate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/7638b6b0445dada5c7f56497fe83bb41cfaf7d31.jpg"},{"name":"Signal Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/1a144f8f945415ec5aa2eac587266181e5c1789a.jpg"},{"name":"Probe Sent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/e17390cd6f5432d47d88841b2da30c49fafe238a.jpg"},{"name":"Dutchman Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/6ee4bef9acc73405422573c5d5b25b3a9fbabb7f.jpg"},{"name":"Tapes Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/957622fbb2391e2ddd32ef5fceaed3709e05b9df.jpg"},{"name":"Voices Played","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/9ea9af17c9f56fca716aba2546f6ce3502d3fd3e.jpg"},{"name":"Words Decoded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/a33a709dc68a418f893664fa477df7392b374bbb.jpg"},{"name":"Eggbug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840590/5e4311a3a59bdd869d7df78196149831a274fb59.jpg"},{"name":"Good Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im